      "body": "## Overview\n\nShield executor futures and release semaphore capacity on actual completion, including submission errors and abandoned worker exceptions.\n\nDraft/WIP: focused regressions have been validated; human review and the remaining checks below are pending before this is ready.\n\n## Claims\n\nShield executor futures and release semaphore capacity on actual completion, including submission errors and abandoned worker exceptions.\n\n## Validation\n\nValidated on a remote Ubuntu x86_64 machine with Ryzen 9 9900X, Python 3.12.13 and PyTorch 2.13.0+cpu, against base `698e79f3bdbbe4fe7d6be6d91b358a7f430753ab`.\n\n```sh\nTRITON_DEFAULT_BACKEND=cpu VLLM_TARGET_DEVICE=cpu OMP_NUM_THREADS=2 PYTHONPATH=. ../.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/utils_/test_async_utils.py --confcutdir=tests/utils_ -q\n```\n\nBaseline: 2 failed, 3 passed. Patched: 5 passed.\n\nApplicable pre-commit checks passed. Upstream CI has not yet been evaluated for this draft.\n\n## Details\n\nTests cover running and queued cancellation, worker errors and submission errors. Full HTTP speech-to-text integration was not run.\n\nAI assistance (OpenAI Codex) was used for analysis, implementation and validation. The submitter's human review remains pending.\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary> Pull Request Checklist </summary>\n\n- [x] I used vLLM's `/pr-checklist` skill.\n- [x] AI assistance was used during the creation of this PR.\n- [x] **Design Fit:** Scoped to the reported contract and reuses existing behavior where possible.\n- [ ] **Testing and Validation:** Focused tests passed; remaining validation and human review are described above.\n- [x] **Code Quality and Style:** Applicable pre-commit checks passed.\n- [x] **Pull Request Contents:** Scope, evidence and limitations are recorded.\n</details>\n",
